      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 10000\n    coupon_rate = 0.05\n    discount_rate = 0.04\n    years = 5\n    annual_coupon = face_value * coupon_rate\n    cash_flows = [annual_coupon] * years\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    pv_coupons = sum(\n        cash_flow / ((1 + discount_rate) ** (i + 1))\n        for i, cash_flow in enumerate(cash_flows)\n    )\n    pv_face_value = face_value / ((1 + discount_rate) ** years)\n    bond_value = pv_coupons + pv_face_value\n    answer = round(bond_value)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
